    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"1\" style=\"layout-grid-mode:char;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:13pt;margin-right:0.55pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span>你继承了你祖先的天生施法能力。这项能力允许你随意对自己施放 </span><em><span>回避侦测nondetection</span></em><span>，而不需要物质成分。</span></p>\n<p class=\"1\" style=\"layout-grid-mode:char;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:13pt;margin-right:0.55pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span>你也可以每日一次施展下列每项法术：</span><em><span>目盲</span></em><em><span style=\"mso-hansi-font-family:宋体\">/</span></em><em><span>耳聋术</span></em><em><span style=\"mso-hansi-font-family:宋体\"> Blindness/Deafness</span></em><span>、</span><em><span>朦胧术</span></em><em><span style=\"mso-hansi-font-family:宋体\">Blur</span></em><span>和</span><em><span>易容术disguise self</span></em><span>。</span></p>\n<p class=\"1\" style=\"layout-grid-mode:char;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:13pt;margin-right:0.55pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span>当你完成一次长休息后，你会重新获得施展这些法术的能力。你的施法关键属性为智力。</span></p>",
